//! |---|---|
//! | [`hash`] | [`HashAlg`], [`Hasher`] (incremental, `Clone` = `Hash#copy`), [`digest`], [`Hmac`], [`hmac`], name resolution |
//! | [`kdf`] | [`pbkdf2`], [`hkdf`] (+ extract/expand) |
